Is she on the rooftop again?

98
00:02:16,110 --> 00:02:17,900
She did enter the classroom this morning.

99
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:21,400
Again? She's so annoying.

100
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:24,240
Saito-san never attends class, does she?

101
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:26,410
I guess she really does get special treatment.

102
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:30,420
Himea...

103
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:49,270
I wonder if class will be over soon.

104
00:03:00,100 --> 00:03:02,240
That was over way too fast.

105
00:03:11,610 --> 00:03:16,630
I didn't expect it to end like this after nine years.

106
00:03:17,610 --> 00:03:21,020
I guess that's why I'm a genius.

107
00:03:24,300 --> 00:03:25,930
Man, I'm starving!

108
00:03:25,930 --> 00:03:27,720
We'll have to hurry, or they'll run out of croquette bread!

109
00:03:44,810 --> 00:03:49,370
You scum! Do you think it's smart to get between me and my meal?

110
00:03:49,370 --> 00:03:50,370
Mirai!

111
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:53,620
Whoa! What's that?

112
00:03:54,250 --> 00:03:55,880
A bug? It's a huge bug, isn't it?

113
00:03:57,610 --> 00:04:00,130
What's going on? What are you doing?

114
00:04:00,340 --> 00:04:04,640
But... doing it out of the blue like that...

115
00:04:11,770 --> 00:04:13,190
The curse is gone!

116
00:04:13,500 --> 00:04:16,520
Mirai of Andu is now fully functional!

117
00:04:20,340 --> 00:04:22,030
Get rid of that thing!

118
00:04:23,780 --> 00:04:26,200
Okay, time for lunch.

119
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:30,200
Say, Taito. Are you buying bread at the cafetera again today?

120
00:04:31,900 --> 00:04:36,960
Um, I was wondering if you were going to buy croquette bread for lunch at the cafeteria.

121
00:04:37,460 --> 00:04:41,710
For lunch? Yeah, I thought about getting some.

122
00:04:42,130 --> 00:04:46,720
You see, today I just happened to wake up early.

123
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:52,730
So I was like "Okay, time to make some lunch!"

124
00:04:52,730 --> 00:04:54,540
But I ended up making a bit too much.

125
00:04:57,600 --> 00:05:01,110
So I made lunch for you too!

126
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,400
Seriously?

127
00:05:02,400 --> 00:05:03,990
It's like he's two-timing with Saito-san!

128
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:06,570
Kurogane-kun is so mean!

129
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:08,370
Kurogane-kun is a female's worst enemy!

130
00:05:08,900 --> 00:05:10,660
He's so going down!

131
00:05:11,100 --> 00:05:12,660
Poor Haruka.

132
00:05:16,700 --> 00:05:19,960
Thank me later and dig in!

133
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,960
Is Taito here?

134
00:05:20,500 --> 00:05:23,130
Let's have lunch together again!

135
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:28,010
Gekkou gave me some money, 
so I bought some croquette bread!

136
00:05:29,470 --> 00:05:31,260
Himea...

137
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:38,230
No, this is, um...

138
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:43,150
I'm dead. I'm so dead.

139
00:05:43,900 --> 00:05:46,780
Hey, Taito. Where do you want to eat today?

140
00:05:46,780 --> 00:05:50,580
On the bench at the courtyard? Or maybe on the roof?

141
00:05:51,700 --> 00:05:55,080
Uh, you know... Um, Himea...

142
00:05:56,150 --> 00:05:57,790
Wait, time-out!

143
00:05:57,890 --> 00:05:57,960
Annoying Idiot Gekkou

144
00:05:57,980 --> 00:05:58,040
Annoying Idiot Gekkou

145
00:05:58,040 --> 00:05:58,850
Annoying Idiot Gekkou

146
00:05:59,200 --> 00:06:01,380
Hello? What is it?

147
00:06:01,380 --> 00:06:02,840
Get over here right now.

148
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:05,260
Huh? Why should I?

149
00:06:05,260 --> 00:06:07,630
This isn't really the best time to be asking questions.

150
00:06:07,630 --> 00:06:09,720
Don't you understand what I'm saying, small fry?

151
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:11,300
Who are you calling a small fry?!

152
00:06:11,300 --> 00:06:12,930
You of course, who else?

153
00:06:13,350 --> 00:06:17,940
Quit screwing around! And why do I have to follow your orders anyway?

154
00:06:17,940 --> 00:06:20,940
A slave's job is to follow his master's orders.

155
00:06:20,940 --> 00:06:25,440
You put me on the student council without my consent!

156
00:06:25,690 --> 00:06:27,450
I didn't ask for your opinion.

157
00:06:27,450 --> 00:06:29,950
You ass. Who the hell do you think you are?

158
00:06:29,950 --> 00:06:31,000
A genius.

159
00:06:33,450 --> 00:06:35,950
Damn that Gekkou!

160
00:06:35,950 --> 00:06:39,580
I-Is that so? Now that's troubling, Kurenai-kun.

161
00:06:39,580 --> 00:06:42,200
I understand. I'll be there in a jiffy.

162
00:06:43,740 --> 00:06:47,340
Sorry, Haruka. The student council president called for me.

163
00:06:47,340 --> 00:06:49,120
He said some urgent stuff came up.

164
00:06:50,180 --> 00:06:53,550
Thanks for the lunch. I'll eat it later.

165
00:06:54,350 --> 00:06:56,020
Oh, I see...

166
00:06:56,020 --> 00:06:59,520
Now that you mention it, you're on the student council now, huh?

167
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:01,980
I guess there's nothing we can do about, since it's for the student council and all.

168
00:07:01,980 --> 00:07:04,190
Y-Yeah! Work just keeps piling up!

169
00:07:04,770 --> 00:07:06,440
C-Come on, Himea!

170
00:07:06,820 --> 00:07:08,900
What? What's up?

171
00:07:14,100 --> 00:07:17,330
This stuff called croquette bread is delicious!

172
00:07:17,330 --> 00:07:24,250
I always thought human food was uncouth and disgusting, but I love everything that you've shown me, Taito!

173
00:07:24,750 --> 00:07:25,250
Himea.

174
00:07:27,210 --> 00:07:30,170
When we defeated Hinata,

175
00:07:31,090 --> 00:07:33,930
I supposedly died, didn't I?

176
00:07:43,730 --> 00:07:45,940
A message to all students.

177
00:07:46,650 --> 00:07:48,440
Due to an inspection of the schoolfacilities,

178
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:51,780
all of today's afternoon classes and club activities are canceled.

179
00:07:53,100 --> 00:07:55,120
I repeat.

180
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:59,080
Due to an inspection of the school facilities, all of today's afternoon classes and club activities are canceled.

181
00:07:59,080 --> 00:08:02,290
All students are encouraged to leave the school building at once.

182
00:08:02,290 --> 00:08:05,420
What? But we were supposed to have the pool this afternoon!

183
00:08:05,420 --> 00:08:09,010
You pervert! You just wanted to see the girls in swimsuits!

184
00:08:15,400 --> 00:08:16,760
A sudden cancellation?

185
00:08:22,640 --> 00:08:24,690
Huh? What the hell's that?!

186
00:08:24,690 --> 00:08:27,770
Oh, what a surprise! They're dylitklis.

187
00:08:27,770 --> 00:08:29,610
Dyl-what now?

188
00:08:29,610 --> 00:08:30,650
Dylitklis.

189
00:08:31,010 --> 00:08:34,320
They're insects from the 7th dimension of Hearse.

190
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:36,560
Ah, I see.

191
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:44,670
Himea, these things don't happen to attack humans, do they?

192
00:08:44,910 --> 00:08:46,170
They do, they're carnivores.

193
00:08:46,420 --> 00:08:49,870
They're really happy since there's so much prey here.

194
00:08:50,300 --> 00:08:51,960
Oh, of course.

195
00:08:54,650 --> 00:08:56,300
Guess I'll have to rough 'em up.

196
00:08:58,470 --> 00:09:00,430
Take this, Shocky Shock attack!

197
00:09:01,020 --> 00:09:02,560
Ah, don't run away!

198
00:09:02,560 --> 00:09:05,370
Oh, so that's how you want it? Then take this!

199
00:09:07,810 --> 00:09:11,190
Ah, I thought I was going to die.

200
00:09:11,190 --> 00:09:13,650
Wait, I actually did die.

201
00:09:13,650 --> 00:09:15,860
But you were still really cool, Taito!

202
00:09:15,860 --> 00:09:18,120
You're late. You'll get the death penalty.

203
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:19,830
I said I already died!

204
00:09:19,830 --> 00:09:20,950
Woah! What the hell is that?!

205
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:24,960
Can't you tell? I guess you're as stupid as a monkey after all.

206
00:09:25,230 --> 00:09:29,710
Eat this! This is my finishing blow, 
Final Finish Last Shocky Shock Attack!

207
00:09:33,550 --> 00:09:36,220
Ew, what the hell's this?

208
00:09:36,630 --> 00:09:39,930
Did you take care of the insect scum that got out of the room?

209
00:09:39,930 --> 00:09:43,180
I wouldn't be here if I didn't, now would I?

210
00:09:43,180 --> 00:09:47,480
I had the principal send the students home, but I guess that was unnecessary.

211
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:49,770
Hey, did you see that?

212
00:09:49,770 --> 00:09:52,110
My Shocky Shock was awesome, right?

213
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:54,490
Hey...

214
00:09:55,400 --> 00:09:58,530
Just what the heck's going on in this school?

215
00:10:06,310 --> 00:10:10,210
Um, for what reason did you summon me?

216
00:10:10,630 --> 00:10:13,360
I'm letting you explain about this school.

217
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:15,110
You should be grateful.

218
00:10:15,110 --> 00:10:19,590
Huh, you really do act like this towards adults too, don't you?

219
00:10:19,590 --> 00:10:20,320
Anyway,

220
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,720
who is she?

221
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:23,350
Suzae Saeko.

222
00:10:23,350 --> 00:10:24,810
She's a military officer.

223
00:10:24,810 --> 00:10:26,350
Military, as in the JSDF?

224
00:10:26,350 --> 00:10:27,690
Or from the American army?

225
00:10:27,690 --> 00:10:28,980
Neither.

226
00:10:29,710 --> 00:10:33,520
We're a magic-based organization acting above national level.

227
00:10:34,020 --> 00:10:38,110
Our authority stretches farther than the police, JSDF, and the government's.

228
00:10:38,350 --> 00:10:41,120
The incompetent always try to hide behind authority.

229
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:45,210
They're working with the people who are after me.

230
00:10:45,210 --> 00:10:46,600
Seriously?!

231
00:10:49,900 --> 00:10:52,500
I love it when you say it like that, Taito.

232
00:10:52,500 --> 00:10:54,640
Huh? But, um...

233
00:10:54,640 --> 00:10:56,890
That means you're wondering if it's true, right?

234
00:10:56,890 --> 00:10:57,670
Yeah.

235
00:10:58,030 --> 00:11:00,430
Then yeah, seriously!

236
00:11:01,800 --> 00:11:10,360
Don't forget that it's thanks to the military's barrier that the Church and Temperon Crowley can't find you here.

237
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:12,100
Yes, I won't forget.

238
00:11:12,940 --> 00:11:16,480
And I won't forget what the military and Church did to me either.

239
00:11:17,110 --> 00:11:19,570
Taito!

240
00:11:20,990 --> 00:11:23,700
Saitohimea is nothing but a shell by now.

241
00:11:23,700 --> 00:11:25,990
Does the military still want her?

242
00:11:25,990 --> 00:11:28,830
We'll decide whether she holds any value or not.

243
00:11:29,310 --> 00:11:30,400
Taito!

244
00:11:30,400 --> 00:11:32,330
Let me see Taito!

245
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:37,630
It is of no matter if she holds any value or not.

246
00:11:37,630 --> 00:11:43,430
As a criminal who sided with Bahlskra, she will be sealed in the void for all eternity.

247
00:11:44,350 --> 00:11:47,480
That is the Church's decision.

248
00:11:51,350 --> 00:11:52,560
Himea.

249
00:11:53,500 --> 00:11:55,200
What's wrong, Himea?

250
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:56,480
Are you feeling sick?

251
00:11:57,050 --> 00:11:58,900
Nah, it's nothing.

252
00:12:00,640 --> 00:12:03,580
You might've noticed already, Kurogane-kun,

253
00:12:03,580 --> 00:12:06,780
but there exist multiple different worlds.

254
00:12:07,140 --> 00:12:09,790
Like the world where the witch, Saitohimea, comes from

255
00:12:10,350 --> 00:12:12,460
and the world of demons like Mirai of Andoh.

256
00:12:12,460 --> 00:12:15,040
Mirai of Andu, Daughter of Indra!

257
00:12:16,780 --> 00:12:21,220
And the demonic plane where Mirai of Andoh, Daughter of Indra comes from.

258
00:12:21,620 --> 00:12:25,550
Those are just two of an innumerable amount of worlds.

259
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:30,100
The worlds are all connected by dimensional rifts.

260
00:12:30,100 --> 00:12:35,180
You have to go through these rifts in order to reach the other worlds.

261
00:12:35,640 --> 00:12:40,940
All of these dimensions intersect here at Miyasaka High School.

262
00:12:41,510 --> 00:12:43,600
Got it, small fry?

263
00:12:44,560 --> 00:12:47,200
Nope, not at all.

264
00:12:47,200 --> 00:12:48,990
What the hell is this?!

265
00:12:48,990 --> 00:12:52,540
I did call you a monkey, but let me rephrase.

266
00:12:52,540 --> 00:12:53,210
Huh?

267
00:12:53,650 --> 00:12:55,210
You're just a mere flea.

268
00:13:01,070 --> 00:13:02,460
Taito...

269
00:13:06,040 --> 00:13:11,720
The military established Miyasaka High School in order to keep this dimensional intersection under close watch.

