590
00:13:19,870 --> 00:13:25,740
We don't know why, but once you pass that age you can no longer traverse the holy ground.

591
00:13:25,740 --> 00:13:26,970
Holy ground?

592
00:13:26,970 --> 00:13:29,410
That's what the military calls the distortions.

593
00:13:29,810 --> 00:13:38,240
The responsibilities of the student council include monitoring the holy ground and eradicating any intruders that might wander in.

594
00:13:39,700 --> 00:13:45,470
And in return, the student council members are free from all student obligations, such as attending class.

595
00:13:45,470 --> 00:13:49,340
The principal and the school's staff are all aware of this.

596
00:13:49,690 --> 00:13:52,680
However, they are not aware of the school's true purpose.

597
00:13:53,460 --> 00:13:54,520
Huh...

598
00:13:54,520 --> 00:13:56,330
The end.

599
00:13:56,330 --> 00:13:57,940
Never ask about it again.

600
00:13:59,870 --> 00:14:01,400
Hey, Gekkou!

601
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:05,300
If the afternoon classes are canceled, does that mean P.E. is canceled as well?

602
00:14:05,300 --> 00:14:08,090
So we're not going to the pool?

603
00:14:08,090 --> 00:14:09,310
Naturally.

604
00:14:09,310 --> 00:14:11,700
No way! I want to swim!

605
00:14:15,790 --> 00:14:18,330
See? I've prepared for it already!

606
00:14:18,650 --> 00:14:21,340
Oh, she had a swimsuit under it.

607
00:14:21,340 --> 00:14:22,960
You can't do that, Taito!

608
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:26,470
Hey, Gekkou! Let's go to the pool! Come on!

609
00:14:26,470 --> 00:14:28,010
Let's go!

610
00:14:28,010 --> 00:14:28,720
Taito!

611
00:14:28,720 --> 00:14:31,210
Ouch! Himea!

612
00:14:31,210 --> 00:14:32,220
Himea?

613
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:38,100
I guess I'll just have to kill every other girl in existence so you won't get distracted.

614
00:14:40,590 --> 00:14:45,280
Um... Can I go yet?

615
00:14:46,110 --> 00:14:47,610
Yahoo!

616
00:14:50,590 --> 00:14:52,430
Gekkou!

617
00:14:52,430 --> 00:14:54,370
Taito!

618
00:14:56,430 --> 00:14:58,440
Isn't that hot?

619
00:15:01,370 --> 00:15:04,630
I more or less understand the circumstances here,

620
00:15:04,860 --> 00:15:07,340
but there's one more thing I want to know.

621
00:15:07,340 --> 00:15:11,510
Why do you have to fight your little twin brother?

622
00:15:13,420 --> 00:15:15,910
He tried to kill me.

623
00:15:15,910 --> 00:15:18,240
I just returned the favor.

624
00:15:19,080 --> 00:15:20,020
That's all.

625
00:15:20,510 --> 00:15:22,830
But that still doesn't mean you can...

626
00:15:22,830 --> 00:15:24,400
It's none of your business.

627
00:15:24,400 --> 00:15:25,270
But...

628
00:15:26,760 --> 00:15:28,530
Why'd you do that?!

629
00:15:28,530 --> 00:15:30,570
This feels great, Gekkou!

630
00:15:30,570 --> 00:15:32,030
Come on in, Taito!

631
00:15:34,120 --> 00:15:37,040
Okay! I'll get it, so stop pulling!

632
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:39,910
Mirai-chan attack!

633
00:15:42,990 --> 00:15:44,280
Are you trying to kill me?!

634
00:15:44,280 --> 00:15:47,050
But you're Immortal-kun, so it's okay!

635
00:15:49,470 --> 00:15:52,590
O-Okay, then I'll have a go too!

636
00:15:52,590 --> 00:15:55,390
Himea-chan attack!

637
00:15:54,720 --> 00:15:56,560
Himea!

638
00:15:57,150 --> 00:15:59,060
I'm dying!

639
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:06,020
Let's see who can stay underwater the longest!

640
00:16:06,020 --> 00:16:08,170
I won't lose to you!

641
00:16:10,680 --> 00:16:12,380
Hinata and I...

642
00:16:12,380 --> 00:16:14,920
We were always together.

643
00:16:14,920 --> 00:16:17,740
If we weren't, we would fall apart.

644
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:22,870
That's what I believed, and I thought Hinata believed the same.

645
00:16:24,200 --> 00:16:26,380
Until that day.

646
00:16:32,740 --> 00:16:34,270
Mom?

647
00:16:35,120 --> 00:16:36,430
Dad?

648
00:16:38,160 --> 00:16:39,430
Oh hey, Nii-san.

649
00:16:40,010 --> 00:16:41,310
You're home early.

650
00:16:42,240 --> 00:16:43,310
Hinata...

651
00:16:43,310 --> 00:16:47,130
Say, can you see this?

652
00:16:49,360 --> 00:16:51,900
Oh, I guess not.

653
00:16:51,900 --> 00:16:54,570
Then I have no use for you, Nii-san.

654
00:16:55,100 --> 00:16:57,080
I should get going.

655
00:16:58,020 --> 00:16:59,560
What's going on?

656
00:17:00,270 --> 00:17:02,160
What are you doing?

657
00:17:02,410 --> 00:17:06,540
I sacrificed Mom and Dad for a nine-year long contract.

658
00:17:06,880 --> 00:17:09,870
Seems like this will be a long journey.

659
00:17:10,510 --> 00:17:12,000
Contract?

660
00:17:12,600 --> 00:17:14,030
Journey?

661
00:17:14,030 --> 00:17:15,090
What does that mean?

662
00:17:15,500 --> 00:17:19,220
I'm letting you live for another nine years.

663
00:17:19,470 --> 00:17:20,680
Nine years?

664
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:23,520
Enjoy your life up until then.

665
00:17:23,520 --> 00:17:25,020
Hinata!

666
00:17:25,470 --> 00:17:27,180
Wait, Hinata!

667
00:17:29,530 --> 00:17:30,940
Nine years?

668
00:17:36,970 --> 00:17:38,400
It's running out?

669
00:17:40,060 --> 00:17:42,880
My nine years are running out!

670
00:17:46,860 --> 00:17:48,670
Screw that!

671
00:17:48,670 --> 00:17:52,780
Hinata, my inferior little brother, is going to kill me?

672
00:17:52,780 --> 00:17:55,770
That's not even funny! As if I'd let him kill me!

673
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:02,470
So, you've come here to kill me?

674
00:18:03,120 --> 00:18:06,120
Nope, I came to devour you.

675
00:18:06,120 --> 00:18:09,980
Hinata offered you as a sacrifice to me.

676
00:18:09,980 --> 00:18:12,730
So your life now belongs to me!

677
00:18:14,670 --> 00:18:19,600
So you were a familiar sent by Hinata to kill Gekkou?

678
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:22,810
Yeah. He summoned me with a magic cirlce.

679
00:18:22,810 --> 00:18:25,500
But Gekkou attacked first,

680
00:18:25,770 --> 00:18:27,960
And pushed me down.

681
00:18:27,960 --> 00:18:30,000
Pushed you down...

682
00:18:30,200 --> 00:18:35,510
Then he stabbed me and stripped me.

683
00:18:37,950 --> 00:18:38,930
Prepare yourself!

684
00:18:40,510 --> 00:18:43,280
I've been ready for a long time now.

685
00:18:43,900 --> 00:18:47,760
You thought I would spend these nine years doing nothing?

686
00:18:51,610 --> 00:18:53,320
You foolish human!

687
00:18:53,320 --> 00:18:55,940
I'll fry you with my lightning!

688
00:18:56,350 --> 00:18:58,950
Exorcise, Spell Error!

689
00:18:59,260 --> 00:19:01,070
Huh? W-Wait a second!

690
00:19:01,070 --> 00:19:02,450
No, I won't!

691
00:19:01,760 --> 00:19:03,620
That's not fair! Time-out!

692
00:19:03,080 --> 00:19:03,830
Silence, small fry!

693
00:19:09,660 --> 00:19:11,280
W-Why...

694
00:19:11,280 --> 00:19:13,500
Why can't I use my power?

695
00:19:13,500 --> 00:19:16,680
Spell Error exorcises all powers.

696
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:19,010
A small fry like you wouldn't stand a chance.

697
00:19:20,270 --> 00:19:23,640
W-Why can you do something like that?

698
00:19:24,990 --> 00:19:27,550
Because I'm a genius.

699
00:19:27,550 --> 00:19:33,630
Then Gekkou used Spell Error and laid a curse upon me and forced me into a contract.

700
00:19:34,150 --> 00:19:38,560
And what's more, Gekkou has to kiss me to remove the seal.

701
00:19:38,560 --> 00:19:40,030
He's so mean, isn't he?

702
00:19:40,510 --> 00:19:41,500
H-Huh?

703
00:19:41,500 --> 00:19:43,030
Where's Gekkou?

704
00:19:51,150 --> 00:19:53,230
Did I startle you?

705
00:19:53,780 --> 00:19:56,440
Who are you?

706
00:19:57,100 --> 00:20:00,160
Now, who might I be?

707
00:20:02,080 --> 00:20:04,910
Well, that doesn't matter since you're leaving.

708
00:20:05,950 --> 00:20:07,810
Wai- Hold on!

709
00:20:07,810 --> 00:20:09,310
Exorcise, Spell Error!

710
00:20:12,440 --> 00:20:14,310
Just kidding!

711
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:19,070
Too bad, but that didn't hurt at all.

712
00:20:20,090 --> 00:20:22,430
Spell Error didn't work?!

713
00:20:28,800 --> 00:20:30,350
Oh, just kidding again.

714
00:20:32,890 --> 00:20:33,670
Impossible!

715
00:20:34,640 --> 00:20:36,710
Don't be so impatient, Gekkou-chan.

716
00:20:38,560 --> 00:20:41,720
Hmph. He left without me.

717
00:20:41,720 --> 00:20:43,560
Gekkou you meanie!

718
00:20:47,820 --> 00:20:51,580
Well, I have a message from Hinata for you, Gekkou-chan.

719
00:20:58,830 --> 00:21:01,820
W-We're suddenly alone, huh?

720
00:21:02,510 --> 00:21:03,420
I-

721
00:21:04,780 --> 00:21:06,360
I guess so.

722
00:21:18,360 --> 00:21:20,920
Red rain?

723
00:21:23,260 --> 00:21:26,930
Huh? I suddenly feel kinda dizzy...

724
00:21:27,200 --> 00:21:29,500
Let's go back inside, Taito.

725
00:21:29,500 --> 00:21:30,810
Himea?

726
00:21:31,530 --> 00:21:36,760
Maybe you didn't notice, but you've 
already died twice because of this rain.

727
00:21:47,740 --> 00:21:51,450
I thought I killed Hinata with my own hands...

728
00:21:53,370 --> 00:21:54,790
I'll repeat what Hinata said.

729
00:21:54,790 --> 00:22:01,760
"You'd better give up on keeping Saitohimea, Nii-san."

730
00:22:01,760 --> 00:22:05,800
A fool like you won't be able to handle that crazy witch.

731
00:22:05,800 --> 00:22:09,760
Especially if you're doing it to piss me off.

732
00:22:09,760 --> 00:22:12,350
But since you probably won't listen,

733
00:22:12,350 --> 00:22:17,930
I'll give you a little warning if you're still planning to keep her.

734
00:22:17,930 --> 00:22:21,310
Beware of the moon's encroachment.

735
00:22:23,800 --> 00:22:25,840
So that's how it is.

736
00:22:26,620 --> 00:22:28,650
Very well, Hinata,

737
00:22:28,650 --> 00:22:32,520
I'll play along with your little game.

738
00:22:41,680 --> 00:22:44,480
hoppe ni odeko ni fuwafuwa no kissu

739
00:22:41,680 --> 00:22:44,480
Fluffy kisses on my cheeks and forehead.

740
00:22:44,480 --> 00:22:47,440
suki no iwanai kana

741
00:22:44,480 --> 00:22:47,440
Won't you tell me that you love me?

742
00:22:47,440 --> 00:22:52,120
demo nandatte kimochii kiss

743
00:22:47,440 --> 00:22:52,120
Cause your kiss feels great.

744
00:23:04,670 --> 00:23:07,460
marshmallow, chocolate, ice cream

745
00:23:04,670 --> 00:23:07,460
Marshmallows, chocolate, and ice cream.

746
00:23:07,460 --> 00:23:10,110
oyatsu no jikan mata kyou shinai?

747
00:23:07,460 --> 00:23:10,110
Will we drink tea again today?

748
00:23:10,110 --> 00:23:16,080
itatte fuutsu no onnanoko nano desu

749
00:23:10,110 --> 00:23:16,080
I'm a normal girl,

750
00:23:16,080 --> 00:23:18,850
dakedo tsuyoi ko de itaishi

751
00:23:16,080 --> 00:23:18,850
but I want to be a strong girl.

752
00:23:18,850 --> 00:23:21,730
kimi no tokubetsuna ko ni naritai

753
00:23:18,850 --> 00:23:21,730
I wanted to be your special one.

754
00:23:21,730 --> 00:23:24,650
te ashi batabata amaeteru

755
00:23:21,730 --> 00:23:24,650
Flapping my hands and legs like a spoiled child,

756
00:23:24,650 --> 00:23:27,590
tokidoki mukashi na ko desu

757
00:23:24,650 --> 00:23:27,590
sometimes being my old self.

758
00:23:27,590 --> 00:23:33,320
sokkenai kimi hontou wa suki de

759
00:23:27,590 --> 00:23:33,320
The truth is that I love your blunt attitude,

760
00:23:33,320 --> 00:23:38,870
terekakushi de ijiwaru shiteru nante ne

761
00:23:33,320 --> 00:23:38,870
teasing me to hide your embarrassment.

762
00:23:38,870 --> 00:23:44,710
hyakumankai kissushite ne hyaku paasento uketoruyo

763
00:23:38,870 --> 00:23:44,710
If you want to kiss me a million times, I'll accept them for sure.

764
00:23:44,710 --> 00:23:47,630
ganbatte homeraretai

765
00:23:44,710 --> 00:23:47,630
I'll try harder, so you will praise me.

766
00:23:47,630 --> 00:23:50,420
hyakuten manten jyanakutemo

767
00:23:47,630 --> 00:23:50,420
Even if I don't score a 100,

768
00:23:50,420 --> 00:23:53,340
hanamaru kurai kureru kana

769
00:23:50,420 --> 00:23:53,340
at least you'll give me a flower circle.

770
00:23:53,340 --> 00:23:55,800
yoku dekimashita demo ii yo

771
00:23:53,340 --> 00:23:55,800
Saying, "You did great!", would be enough.

772
00:23:55,800 --> 00:23:58,890
kimi de yorokobi kao mietara

773
00:23:55,800 --> 00:23:58,890
Whenever I see your smiling face,

774
00:23:58,890 --> 00:24:03,480
ureshikutte sakenjauyo

775
00:23:58,890 --> 00:24:03,480
I let out a shout of joy!

776
00:24:11,660 --> 00:24:14,000
Hello! It's Mirai!

777
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:16,720
Um, what was it again?

778
00:24:16,720 --> 00:24:17,890
Erm...

779
00:24:17,890 --> 00:24:21,480
Oh, right! I'm a really powerful demon!

780
00:24:21,480 --> 00:24:24,800
You see, I'm a descendant of this really famous demon!

781
00:24:24,800 --> 00:24:28,570
Mama always told me how great I was!

782
00:24:28,570 --> 00:24:31,530
